1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:11,079
How learning works: payment, approval, live class, notes.

2
00:00:11,079 --> 00:00:22,260
Every step unlocks the next inside your student account.

3
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:30,870
Pay into the ABSA account using your student number as reference.

4
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:41,540
Then upload the proof of payment inside the portal.

5
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:49,108
The academy admin reviews your POP from the dashboard.

6
00:00:49,108 --> 00:00:58,340
Once accepted, your payment status flips and the portal unlocks.

7
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:06,748
Accepted students get the live lesson card with the Join button.

8
00:01:06,748 --> 00:01:17,140
Meeting ID, passcode and instructor come from the scheduled lecture.

9
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:25,481
Progress tracking shows verified chapters and a completion percentage.

10
00:01:25,481 --> 00:01:35,780
Your instructor adds evaluation and feedback chapter by chapter.

11
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:44,894
Published notes open in the protected reader, chapter by chapter.

12
00:01:44,894 --> 00:01:56,260
Watermarked, read only, and only for accepted students.

13
00:01:57,360 --> 00:02:03,442
Admins publish documents, schedule Zoom links and update progress.

14
00:02:03,442 --> 00:02:12,140
Everything a student sees is managed from one dashboard.

15
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:17,675
One portal: pay, learn live, track progress, read the notes.

16
00:02:17,675 --> 00:02:24,100
Rover Trading Academy.
